# Prettier does not read .gitignore, so without this a bare
# `npx prettier --check .` walks build output and scratch space and
# reports failures on files nothing else in the toolchain checks.
# Mirrors what the rest of the tooling already skips — see
# `gitignore: true` in .markdownlint-cli2.yaml, `exclude` in ruff.toml,
# and `ignorePaths` in cspell.config.yaml.
#
# The pre-commit hook is unaffected: it only ever passes staged files,
# and everything listed here is git-ignored.

.superpowers/
.venv/
node_modules/
site/
untracked/
